@startuml View Order Details - Sequence Diagram

actor Customer
participant "OrderController" as OrderCtrl
participant "Order" as Order
participant "OrderItem" as OrderItem
participant "View" as View

== View Order Details ==
Customer -> OrderCtrl: show(order)
OrderCtrl -> Order: find(id)
Order --> OrderCtrl: order
OrderCtrl -> OrderItem: where(order_id)->with(product)
OrderItem --> OrderCtrl: order_items
OrderCtrl -> View: show orders.show(order, order_items)
View --> Customer: display order details

@enduml
